# Sample App Development Guidelines

## 🎯 Sample App Purpose

The `AEPSampleAppNewArchEnabled` demonstrates:
- **React Native New Architecture** integration
- **Expo Router** navigation patterns
- **All AEP SDK packages** usage examples
- **Real device testing** capabilities

## 📱 Expo Router Structure

### Navigation Pattern
```typescript
// app/_layout.tsx - Root layout with tabs
export default function RootLayout() {
  return (
    <Tabs>
      <Tabs.Screen name="index" options={{ title: 'Home' }} />
      <Tabs.Screen name="AssuranceView" options={{ title: 'Assurance' }} />
    </Tabs>
  );
}

// app/index.tsx - Main screen
export default function HomeScreen() {
  // Implementation
}
```

### File-based Routing
- **`app/_layout.tsx`** - Root layout configuration
- **`app/index.tsx`** - Home screen
- **`app/[screen].tsx`** - Dynamic routes
- **`app/+not-found.tsx`** - 404 handling

## 🔧 SDK Integration Patterns

### Core SDK Setup
```typescript
// Initialize all AEP SDKs in the root layout
import MobileCore from '@adobe/react-native-aepcore';
import Edge from '@adobe/react-native-aepedge';
import Messaging from '@adobe/react-native-aepmessaging';

// Configure in app startup
MobileCore.configureWithAppId('your-app-id');
MobileCore.start(() => {
  // Post-init logic
});
```

