## 🧪 Testing & Development

### Local Development
```bash
# Start Expo development server
yarn sampleappnewarchenabled:expo:start

# Run on iOS
yarn sampleappnewarchenabled:ios:run

# Run on Android  
yarn sampleappnewarchenabled:android:run
```

### Required Configurations
- **iOS**: Proper CocoaPods integration ([apps/AEPSampleAppNewArchEnabled/ios/](mdc:apps/AEPSampleAppNewArchEnabled/ios/))
- **Android**: Gradle configuration
- **Expo**: New Architecture enabled in [app.json](mdc:apps/AEPSampleAppNewArchEnabled/app.json)

